Video permission filter (src/video-ops/perms.ts)

src/video-ops/perms.ts adapts the perms filter of FFmpeg libavfilter/f_perms.c
(CONFIG_PERMS_FILTER, ff_vf_perms): its option table (mode none/ro/rw/toggle/
random, seed in [-1, UINT32_MAX], positional order mode then seed), the absence
of query_formats, and its filter_frame, which only changes frame writability
(ff_inlink_make_frame_writable or av_frame_clone) and forwards the pixels,
geometry, format and timestamps unchanged.

Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
